  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p style=\"\"><span>Hi all，</span><span><br /></span><span>【2026年527】3款活动玩法即将</span><span>上线，活动设置小映礼物玩法、礼物玩法、功能玩法，现申请相关</span><span><span class=\"currentHitHighlight\" style=\"color: rgb(255,255,255);\">st</span></span><span>：</span><br /><span><br /></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">辛苦</span><strong style=\"\">@叶导&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">确认；</span><br style=\"\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">辛苦</span><strong style=\"\">@成武</strong><strong style=\"\">&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">核对</span></p><p style=\"\"><br /></p><p style=\"\"><br /></p><p style=\"\"><br /><span>详细需求如下：</span><span><br />一、活动目标：</span><span><br /></span><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">礼物玩法：日均消耗2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">00万钻</span></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">特殊小礼物：日均消耗150万钻</span></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">功能玩法：日均消耗200万钻</span></p><p style=\"\"><br /><span>二、玩法说明：</span><br />分别小映玩法变种、功能玩法、特殊小礼物玩法</p><p style=\"\"><span>&nbsp;</span><span><br />三、后台申请需求：</span><span><br />本次需申请10个source type，扣钻，产出映币、下发使用</span><span><br /></span><span>辛苦FMS后台审批；</span><span><br />以上，感谢！</span><span><br />如有疑问钉钉联系~​</span></p>",
      "representation": "storage",
      "_expandable": {
        "content": "/rest/api/content/497223784"
      }
    },
